<title>UK: Ventspils port closed due to high winds-source.</title>
<headline>Ventspils port closed due to high winds-source.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia's oil export port of Ventspils was closed from midnight on Tuesday due to high winds, a shipping source said.</p>
<p>The Black Sea port of Novorossiisk was open with three cargoes alongside. Other Black Sea ports at Odessa and Tuapse were also operating normally, the source added.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
</text>
